# Bangwing IN — redirect rules (Netlify & Cloudflare Pages)
# v6: redirect any indexed .html URLs to their extensionless canonical form.
# This is a 301 (permanent) so link equity transfers cleanly. Once search
# engines re-crawl and pick up the new sitemap, these rules become no-ops.

/our-story.html    /our-story      301!
/community.html    /community       301!
/events.html       /events          301!
/achievements.html /achievements    301!
/safety.html       /safety           301!
/store.html        /store            301!
/contact.html      /contact          301!
/join.html         /join             301!
/index.html        /                 301!

# www → apex (uncomment if you register www.bangwings.xyz)
# https://www.bangwings.xyz/*  https://bangwings.xyz/:splat  301!
